# BlindScore

- Read `.agents/skills/deepspace/SKILL.md` before writing DeepSpace code. Never invent SDK APIs.
- Clients NEVER write BlindScore collections. All writes go through `src/actions/index.ts`.
- Never put scores in `candidates`, `submissions`, or `debriefs`. Scores live only in `scorecards` and `reveals`.
- Never return raw records from actions. Return ids and flags.
- Identity comes only from `ctx.userId`.
- No API keys, secrets, or new dependencies without asking.
- Small diffs. Strict TypeScript. No `any` in final code.
